WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.100
We have reasserted that America belongs to the American people,

00:05.100 --> 00:08.600
and I encourage all countries to take their own stand

00:08.600 --> 00:12.180
in defense of their citizens as well.

00:12.180 --> 00:14.620
You have to do that because I see it.

